 "climate", "change", "resilience", "miami"], "long_description": "Rising Tides: Miami\u2019s Future is an immersive Meta Quest experience that puts you at the center of Miami\u2019s battle against hurricanes, flooding, and sea-level rise\u2014and the innovative solutions that can help protect it.\n\nExplore Little Havana, Brickell, and Virginia Key using interactive 3D models, aerial views, and real-world photorealistic flooding simulations. Witness firsthand how extreme weather threatens homes, businesses, and infrastructure while discovering flood barriers, home elevation, seawalls, and nature-based defenses that can help safeguard the city.\n\nFeel the force of hurricane winds and storm surges as you navigate through Miami\u2019s most vulnerable neighborhoods. Through cutting-edge VR technology, experience different flooding scenarios and see how engineering and community-driven strategies can build a more resilient future.", "short_description": "Rising Tides: Miami\u2019s Future is an immersive Meta Quest experience exploring Miami\u2019s fight against hurricanes, flooding, and sea-level rise. Visit Little Havana, Brickell, and Virginia Key to witness the impact and discover real-world solutions."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://virtualplanet.tech/privacy-policy-app", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Planet Technologies", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://virtualplanet.tech/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "es_MX"], "supported_